{"code":"387570","name":"파인메딕스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"건강관리장비와용품","sector_desc":"의료기기·진단기기·의료용품. 수출 비중이 높고 인허가와 해외 판매 성과가 핵심입니다.","desc":"동사는 2009년 설립된 소화기 내시경 시술기구 전문 기업으로, 2024년 기술성장기업으로 코스닥시장에 상장함. ESD 및 EMR 시술용 나이프, 인젝터, 스네어 등 핵심 제품을 직접 개발하고, 초음파 내시경용 조직 채취 시술기구(EUS-FNA/FNB) 등 고부가가치 제품을 선보이고 있음. CE 및 FDA 인증 획득으로 해외 수출 확대하고, 일본 가델리우스와의 ODM 계약 등 글로벌 기업들과 협력하며 성장하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-23","n_days":300,"close":5960.0,"open":5910.0,"high":6060.0,"low":5600.0,"volume":5214,"amount":31075440.0,"ret_1d":-0.1675,"gap":-1.005,"range_pct":7.7181,"ret_5":0.1681,"ret_20":-7.7399,"ret_60":42.4134,"ret_120":-16.2921,"ret_250":-28.8783,"ma20":6159.0,"ma60":5871.6667,"ma120":5872.25,"ma200":6369.0,"close_vs_ma200":-6.4217,"close_vs_ma60":1.5044,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":290.574,"r2_60":0.4541,"slope_120":-14.5339,"r2_120":0.0148,"slope_250":-35.8019,"r2_250":0.4854,"high52":9230.0,"low52":3755.0,"pos_52w":40.274,"dd_52w":-35.428,"mdd_1y":-54.6512,"atr14_pct":7.3466,"vol_ann_60":38.0805,"vol_avg20":6747.15,"vol_ratio20":0.7728,"vr5":0.5474,"vr20":0.1945,"amount_avg5":32012186.0,"amount_avg20":41758148.0,"amount_avg60":49793940.9167,"obv_chg20":-36.2946,"turnover_20":2.3986,"pv_eff_20":-3.2269,"rsi14":42.4607,"frgn_net_5":143.0,"inst_net_5":8000.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0025,"inst_net_5_pct":0.1422,"smart_net_5_pct":0.1447,"frgn_net_20":-915.0,"inst_net_20":37450.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0163,"inst_net_20_pct":0.6657,"smart_net_20_pct":0.6494,"frgn_net_60":-36623.0,"inst_net_60":119913.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.651,"inst_net_60_pct":2.1314,"smart_net_60_pct":1.4805,"frgn_net_120":23345.0,"inst_net_120":119913.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.415,"inst_net_120_pct":2.1314,"smart_net_120_pct":2.5464,"foreign_ratio":1.12,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.55,"smart_buy_streak":16,"op_income_q":8.0,"op_margin_q":20.0,"op_qoq":200.0,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":260.0,"rev_yoy":60.0,"op_trend_4q":71.4286,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-3.12,"debt_ratio":26.24,"per":null,"pbr":1.69,